+# bbhost engine ports
+
+Source: https://github.com/droogie/bbhost/tree/7c790536c2c27ad7bb5115e3b1a12d7ffd7a972e
+
+`gpu/shim/engine/engine_hooks.cpp` adapts `src/core/thunk.cpp` (the prologue emitter).
